{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-006-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/GameStateRecorderLedgerTests.cs","line":1455,"method":"OnVesselRecoveryFunds_EmptyVesselName_SkipsSilently","category":"T1","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerRecoveryFundsPairing.cs:504; delete the !identity.HasName guard -> the calls defer instead of skipping, ledger count unchanged, cell green; assert PendingRecoveryFundsCountForTesting==0 -> red","what_it_asserts":"Empty-string and null vessel names produce no ledger action.","why_weak":"Skip and silent defer both satisfy the lone assert (Ledger.Actions.Count), so the guard is unobserved; a nameless deferred request could later pair via the nameless nearest-UT fallback in FindBestPairingIndex.","proposed_action":"Assert PendingRecoveryFundsCountForTesting stays 0 after both calls and assert the 'empty vesselName ... skipping' verbose line.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"LedgerRecoveryFundsPairing","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerRecoveryFundsPairing.cs","sut_line":591,"case_kind":"negative","proposed_name":"OnVesselRecoveryFunds_PairedEventNonPositiveDelta_WritesNoRowAndConsumesEvent","sketch":"Queue a recovery callback with no paired event yet, then add FundsChanged(VesselRecovery) valueBefore=1000 valueAfter=900 and fire OnRecoveryFundsEventRecorded; assert no FundsEarning/Recovery row, PendingRecoveryFundsCountForTesting 0 (request consumed), and a second replay adds nothing.","guards":"The delta<=0 early return at LedgerRecoveryFundsPairing.cs:591: without it a negative/zero recovery writes a negative credit into the career ledger, or (if it returned false) the request stays queued and re-pairs later. No test in the tree constructs a VesselRecovery event with valueAfter<=valueBefore.","risk":"career"}
